schway-screen 1
screen shell-outcomes
title Shell exit evidence
description Exit codes, cancellation, timeout, unknown evidence and tool errors retain distinct text and glyphs.
variant dark-50
size 50x36
cursor 6 33 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project

  ✓  BASH   exit 0            Exit 0 · 1.2s ▸
  !  BASH   exit 7            Exit 7 · 1.2s ▸
  −  BASH   kill -TERM $$    Stopped · 1.2s ▸
  −  BASH   sleep 5                 Stopped ▸
    Command cancelled.

  !  BASH   sleep 5               Timed out ▾
    Command timed out.
    Tool failed. Inspect this result before
    continuing.

  −  BASH   run saved com… No exit observed ▸
  −  BASH   inspect inval… No exit observed ▸
  !  BASH   run unavailable com… Tool error ▾
    Command could not start.
    Tool failed. Inspect this result before
    continuing.












